WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:12.303 --> 00:00:15.682
AS YOU STOOD BY

2
00:00:17.142 --> 00:00:20.270
EUN-SU AND HUI-SU

3
00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:58.224
I thought he was working late?

4
00:00:59.642 --> 00:01:01.144
What the hell?

5
00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:18.411
Is everything okay?
You're home early.

6
00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:22.165
Why am I flying to Shanghai... tomorrow?

7
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.626
What... what do you mean?

8
00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:28.713
I have a one-way ticket to Shanghai,
in business class, tomorrow night.

9
00:01:29.547 --> 00:01:31.965
- How come?
- I'm not sure. I wouldn't know.

10
00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:34.761
I'm not asking you again. What did you do?

11
00:01:53.988 --> 00:01:55.657
You're up to something, aren't you?

12
00:01:57.659 --> 00:02:00.036
Eun-su came by to borrow an outfit.

13
00:02:21.182 --> 00:02:22.725
What are you looking for?

14
00:02:41.619 --> 00:02:42.745
Huh.

15
00:02:48.918 --> 00:02:51.588
You're gonna have to explain this.

16
00:02:52.297 --> 00:02:53.339
What are you up to?

17
00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:56.009
- Huh?
- No!

18
00:02:56.718 --> 00:02:57.968
Let her go!

19
00:02:57.969 --> 00:03:00.680
You stay out of this. I warned you.

20
00:03:04.893 --> 00:03:06.643
You stupid bitch.

21
00:03:06.644 --> 00:03:08.646
Come on, come on.

22
00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:11.107
- Hey!
- Ah!

23
00:03:25.038 --> 00:03:26.121
Get up.

24
00:03:26.122 --> 00:03:28.625
Now tell me why you're here.

25
00:03:31.878 --> 00:03:33.296
Ah fuck!

26
00:03:33.796 --> 00:03:35.881
Stop it! Stop it!

27
00:03:49.145 --> 00:03:52.649
I'll ask you again. Why are you here, huh?

28
00:03:54.859 --> 00:03:57.444
I told you to stay out of my business.

29
00:03:57.445 --> 00:04:00.114
But you just had to cross the line. Huh?

30
00:05:05.763 --> 00:05:06.723
So?

31
00:05:10.059 --> 00:05:12.978
Were you planning
to kill me with this? Huh?

32
00:05:12.979 --> 00:05:15.188
Choke me to death like this? Huh?

33
00:05:17.358 --> 00:05:19.234
Like this? Huh?

34
00:05:19.235 --> 00:05:20.903
Hey?

35
00:05:21.446 --> 00:05:22.739
Didn't work.

36
00:05:23.698 --> 00:05:26.826
'Cause I'm here to stay.
You hear?

37
00:05:27.618 --> 00:05:29.953
I warned ya! Huh?

38
00:05:29.954 --> 00:05:32.832
Now you pay with your life.

39
00:05:35.501 --> 00:05:36.794
Die!

40
00:06:11.245 --> 00:06:13.997
Hui-su. Hui-su, stop.

41
00:07:11.264 --> 00:07:13.140
Eun-su, you need to go.

42
00:07:13.141 --> 00:07:14.975
No one can know you were here.

43
00:07:14.976 --> 00:07:17.186
- What? No.
- I was the one who did this!

44
00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:18.937
No, <i>we</i> did this.

45
00:07:18.938 --> 00:07:20.481
Eun-su!

46
00:07:22.442 --> 00:07:24.109
This changes nothing.

47
00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:27.279
I take Jang to the airport,
and he goes to Shanghai.

48
00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:30.491
And then we drive out to the woods,
just like we said.

49
00:08:03.858 --> 00:08:06.027
Pull it together.

50
00:08:37.183 --> 00:08:38.934
Oh! You are here!

51
00:08:38.935 --> 00:08:41.937
I hope it's not too forward,
but I brought you some tangerines.

52
00:08:41.938 --> 00:08:43.855
I bought too many,
and they're all getting ripe,

53
00:08:43.856 --> 00:08:45.482
so I thought I should share them.

54
00:08:45.483 --> 00:08:46.567
Do you like tangerines?

55
00:08:47.527 --> 00:08:49.528
Sorry, I'm not feeling well.

56
00:08:49.529 --> 00:08:51.738
Do you mind leaving them by the door?

57
00:08:51.739 --> 00:08:54.283
I think I might be contagious. Thank you.

58
00:09:23.938 --> 00:09:26.983
SORRY, SCRATCHED YOUR CAR
PLEASE CONTACT ME, UNIT 1401

59
00:09:29.569 --> 00:09:31.946
What if she heard the noise
and got suspicious?

60
00:09:33.489 --> 00:09:34.991
She brought you fruit.

61
00:09:35.575 --> 00:09:37.660
I know she knows what Jin-pyo was doing.

62
00:09:44.125 --> 00:09:45.625
If she heard something,

63
00:09:45.626 --> 00:09:48.628
then she probably came to check on you
and gave you her number just in case.

64
00:09:48.629 --> 00:09:51.673
What if she came by to check on me
and realized what was going on?

65
00:09:51.674 --> 00:09:55.761
- She could be calling the police.
- Mm, but she's never seen anything, right?

66
00:09:56.387 --> 00:09:58.306
We stick to the plan, no matter what.

67
00:10:24.707 --> 00:10:25.915
Were they at it again?

68
00:10:25.916 --> 00:10:27.792
Today it was different.

69
00:10:27.793 --> 00:10:30.587
I talked to her earlier,
and she had someone there.

70
00:10:30.588 --> 00:10:31.630
You went up there?

71
00:10:31.631 --> 00:10:33.674
To give her tangerines.

72
00:10:34.383 --> 00:10:36.636
Let's go out!
I don't want to cook tonight.

73
00:10:37.261 --> 00:10:39.095
- Seriously?
- I'm craving <i>tteokbokki.</i>

74
00:10:39.096 --> 00:10:40.138
So I have to go change?

75
00:10:40.139 --> 00:10:41.973
No, you don't. Those pants are clean.

76
00:10:41.974 --> 00:10:44.101
Hyeon-ji! We're going out for dinner!

77
00:11:28.771 --> 00:11:30.106
I'll clean it.

78
00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:56.715
ALWAYS AND FOREVER

79
00:12:36.046 --> 00:12:38.673
One, two, three...

80
00:12:38.674 --> 00:12:42.552
<i>♪ Friends walk through life together ♪</i>

81
00:12:42.553 --> 00:12:45.388
<i>♪ Those happy days were mine ♪</i>

82
00:12:45.389 --> 00:12:46.639
What is this?

83
00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:49.934
<i>♪ One sentence, one lifetime ♪</i>

84
00:12:49.935 --> 00:12:52.730
<i>♪ With heart and a cup of wine ♪</i>

85
00:12:53.814 --> 00:12:56.107
- You're leaving?
- Stay!

86
00:12:59.403 --> 00:13:00.905
Shots when you get back!

87
00:13:11.123 --> 00:13:13.792
It's my treat.
Feel free to order whatever you want.

88
00:13:13.793 --> 00:13:16.628
Oh. I guess they knew that.

89
00:13:16.629 --> 00:13:19.298
I don't think they have decent Korean
where you're going.

90
00:13:37.942 --> 00:13:39.777
It came up pretty fast, huh?

91
00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:42.363
Something wrong at home?

92
00:13:44.698 --> 00:13:45.533
Uh...

93
00:13:47.243 --> 00:13:48.786
Uh, I think my son needs me.

94
00:13:49.703 --> 00:13:50.704
Oh.

95
00:13:59.296 --> 00:14:00.798
So you miss him too much.

96
00:14:07.012 --> 00:14:07.847
And your boat?

97
00:14:09.431 --> 00:14:11.057
Hope you found a safe route?

98
00:14:11.058 --> 00:14:12.434
Where do you start?

99
00:14:13.018 --> 00:14:14.186
Pyeongtaek?

100
00:14:15.104 --> 00:14:15.980
Gunsan?

101
00:14:22.278 --> 00:14:23.111
Incheon?

102
00:14:23.112 --> 00:14:24.572
Yeah.

103
00:14:25.281 --> 00:14:26.948
Oh, they've been cracking down there.

104
00:14:26.949 --> 00:14:29.201
You'll have to be careful.
Security is really tight.

105
00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:37.293
You are heading to Incheon Harbor,
not airport?

106
00:14:38.294 --> 00:14:39.419
The airport!

107
00:14:41.922 --> 00:14:45.551
Yeah, but flying home would be great, huh?

108
00:14:48.888 --> 00:14:51.473
If you're leaving 'cause of trouble,
I can't really cover for you.

109
00:14:52.808 --> 00:14:54.434
Uh, you won't have to.

110
00:14:54.435 --> 00:14:55.436
Jo Eun-su.

111
00:14:58.022 --> 00:14:59.481
She knows you're leaving?

112
00:15:05.321 --> 00:15:07.948
Jo Eun-su? Who's that?

113
00:15:16.957 --> 00:15:19.752
We had a couple meetings at the warehouse.
I thought you met her.

114
00:15:20.419 --> 00:15:22.004
Head back in. I'll be in soon.

115
00:15:22.504 --> 00:15:23.505
Okay.

116
00:15:57.665 --> 00:16:00.250
MR. JIN SO-BAEK

117
00:16:14.682 --> 00:16:15.932
MR. JANG KANG

118
00:16:20.229 --> 00:16:22.605
No way. He's no good.

119
00:16:22.606 --> 00:16:25.609
All he does is sing the old songs
like the ones my grandma loved.

120
00:16:48.382 --> 00:16:49.216
POWERING OFF

121
00:16:51.427 --> 00:16:53.929
RESETTING DEVICE

122
00:17:40.601 --> 00:17:42.685
Don't you remember
washing these last night?

123
00:17:42.686 --> 00:17:44.438
I thought it'd be better to do it again.

124
00:17:49.902 --> 00:17:52.488
I keep sneezing.
Did you spray all your perfume?

125
00:17:53.363 --> 00:17:55.908
I wanted to hide the smell.
I guess I overdid it.

126
00:17:57.159 --> 00:17:59.119
We already used air freshener last night.

127
00:18:02.873 --> 00:18:05.209
You're more sensitive than me, I guess.

128
00:18:10.923 --> 00:18:12.007
Did you get it ready?

129
00:18:13.592 --> 00:18:14.468
Mm-hmm.

130
00:18:22.935 --> 00:18:23.894
Yeah?

131
00:18:25.854 --> 00:18:27.021
What, you're here?

132
00:18:31.568 --> 00:18:34.279
I thought I'd show up early.

133
00:18:35.239 --> 00:18:36.406
Good thinking.

134
00:18:54.466 --> 00:18:56.009
Such a nice house.

135
00:18:56.677 --> 00:18:58.886
And it smells really good.

136
00:18:58.887 --> 00:19:00.180
Uh-huh.

137
00:19:17.739 --> 00:19:21.075
So I asked you to come over
to try on this suit.

138
00:19:21.076 --> 00:19:22.618
It looks good on you.

139
00:19:22.619 --> 00:19:25.664
Thank you. It's a very nice suit.

140
00:19:27.207 --> 00:19:29.376
And the bag too.

141
00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:33.255
I'll give you the passport at the airport.
Is this all you have?

142
00:19:34.798 --> 00:19:38.635
Yeah. I don't have much to bring back,
except what you bought.

143
00:19:42.723 --> 00:19:44.224
You'll go down first.

144
00:19:44.892 --> 00:19:46.309
The suitcase is heavy.

145
00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:47.561
Oh, right.

146
00:19:53.275 --> 00:19:54.902
I called a car for you.

147
00:19:59.573 --> 00:20:00.657
Wait.

148
00:20:01.158 --> 00:20:02.201
Here.

149
00:20:14.087 --> 00:20:15.047
Oh!

150
00:20:22.095 --> 00:20:23.055
Oh.

151
00:20:35.484 --> 00:20:36.526
Ooh!

152
00:20:38.695 --> 00:20:39.696
Wow.

153
00:20:41.031 --> 00:20:42.615
I don't know what to say.

154
00:20:42.616 --> 00:20:44.034
Thank you so much.

155
00:20:47.537 --> 00:20:49.956
So I'll see you in a bit.

156
00:20:49.957 --> 00:20:51.083
Yes.

157
00:21:18.652 --> 00:21:20.946
<i>First floor.
The doors are closing.</i>

158
00:21:49.224 --> 00:21:50.308
Right there.

159
00:21:50.309 --> 00:21:51.727
Stop, I wanna get out.

160
00:22:02.279 --> 00:22:03.947
I'll call you when he boards.

161
00:22:31.099 --> 00:22:32.517
PARKING VIOLATION NOTICE

162
00:23:07.969 --> 00:23:09.554
Where are the black ones?

163
00:23:19.815 --> 00:23:20.649
Eun-su?

164
00:23:25.112 --> 00:23:26.238
<i>It's me.</i>

165
00:23:34.871 --> 00:23:36.289
Jin-young.

166
00:23:37.332 --> 00:23:38.833
Sounds like you were expecting someone?

167
00:23:38.834 --> 00:23:42.295
Uh, just one of my neighbors
who left her colander here.

168
00:23:43.338 --> 00:23:45.214
Guess you're pretty close
with your neighbors,

169
00:23:45.215 --> 00:23:47.300
greeting them in your bare feet and all.

170
00:23:51.179 --> 00:23:53.306
Those aren't my brother's shoes, are they?

171
00:23:53.890 --> 00:23:56.518
Uh, he only wears them
when he does volunteer work.

172
00:23:57.269 --> 00:23:59.354
I'm not surprised.

173
00:23:59.855 --> 00:24:01.231
I just need to freshen up.

174
00:24:02.274 --> 00:24:05.109
My training was messy.
Hope you don't mind.

175
00:24:05.110 --> 00:24:06.278
'Course not.

176
00:24:27.757 --> 00:24:29.801
How'd this blood get here?

177
00:24:41.730 --> 00:24:42.771
What's that smell?

178
00:24:42.772 --> 00:24:46.151
Oh, I accidentally spilled
the air freshener.

179
00:24:46.943 --> 00:24:47.986
Oh.

180
00:24:49.821 --> 00:24:51.739
You wanna come sit in here?

181
00:24:51.740 --> 00:24:53.283
I'm not staying.

182
00:25:01.541 --> 00:25:04.084
My socks are clean.

183
00:25:04.085 --> 00:25:05.629
Let me make you a coffee.

184
00:25:06.880 --> 00:25:08.173
All right.

185
00:25:18.600 --> 00:25:20.060
Is my brother at work?

186
00:25:21.853 --> 00:25:23.687
Called him on the way here,

187
00:25:23.688 --> 00:25:25.856
but it went straight to voicemail.

188
00:25:25.857 --> 00:25:27.526
Is everything all right?

189
00:25:34.407 --> 00:25:36.910
Yeah. It's a work thing.

190
00:25:38.245 --> 00:25:40.372
Get me a glass of water instead,
would you?

191
00:25:40.872 --> 00:25:42.498
Ow!

192
00:25:54.094 --> 00:25:56.555
Oh, it's the snow globe.

193
00:25:59.182 --> 00:26:00.308
Ah...

194
00:26:01.226 --> 00:26:02.852
It's chipped right here.

195
00:26:03.853 --> 00:26:06.147
I better get you that water.

196
00:26:13.780 --> 00:26:17.701
Hey, didn't you have pictures
from your wedding or something over there?

197
00:26:24.708 --> 00:26:25.834
Have you been arguing?

198
00:26:28.628 --> 00:26:29.462
Here you are.

199
00:27:46.039 --> 00:27:47.165
Get in.

200
00:28:24.452 --> 00:28:25.704
NOH JIN-PYO

201
00:28:26.663 --> 00:28:29.624
You must've found
a great investment opportunity, sir.

202
00:29:00.238 --> 00:29:02.782
NOH JIN-PYO

203
00:29:15.253 --> 00:29:17.839
<i>Here's the combination
for the belt and suitcase.</i>

204
00:29:30.185 --> 00:29:32.061
BATTLE ROBOT

205
00:29:56.461 --> 00:29:59.046
<i>Jin-pyo,
the Presidential Office evaluation</i>

206
00:29:59.047 --> 00:30:00.798
<i>is coming up soon.</i>

207
00:30:00.799 --> 00:30:03.008
<i>You know they do
a family background check, right?</i>

208
00:30:03.009 --> 00:30:05.303
<i>So I need you
to keep a low profile until I'm in.</i>

209
00:30:06.054 --> 00:30:07.180
DELETE MESSAGE

210
00:30:23.822 --> 00:30:25.698
Shit.

211
00:30:26.324 --> 00:30:27.700
He wouldn't have.

212
00:30:29.285 --> 00:30:31.621
That snow globe's
heavy enough to kill her.

213
00:30:43.049 --> 00:30:45.009
<i>Especially when it comes
to your private life.</i>

214
00:30:47.679 --> 00:30:48.638
DELETE MESSAGE

215
00:31:08.533 --> 00:31:09.659
<i>Yeah?</i>

216
00:31:10.451 --> 00:31:12.452
It's just to remind you
to go to the foreigner's line

217
00:31:12.453 --> 00:31:14.038
at Shanghai immigration.

218
00:31:15.623 --> 00:31:16.833
Yes, of course.

219
00:31:23.923 --> 00:31:27.260
Turn it on when you land,
then turn it off again before you toss it.

220
00:31:28.386 --> 00:31:29.761
I will, yeah.

221
00:31:29.762 --> 00:31:31.389
<i>Farewell, Mr. Noh Jin-pyo.</i>

222
00:31:32.015 --> 00:31:33.808
Safe travels back to your boy.

223
00:32:01.753 --> 00:32:03.922
- Is he gone?
- <i>He just went through security.</i>

224
00:32:07.550 --> 00:32:10.803
<i>Oh, Jin-pyo's sister sent a few texts
while I had his phone.</i>

225
00:32:12.055 --> 00:32:13.348
She was here a little earlier.

226
00:32:14.223 --> 00:32:15.516
What? Why?

227
00:32:16.351 --> 00:32:18.144
She saw the snow globe too.

228
00:32:19.145 --> 00:32:22.815
Ah, well, don't worry about that.
The texts were about her evaluation.

229
00:32:23.858 --> 00:32:26.903
But there was this other one
where she asked him to be more discreet.

230
00:32:27.487 --> 00:32:29.614
Do you think maybe
he was hiding something?

231
00:32:32.992 --> 00:32:34.118
I don't know.

232
00:36:47.371 --> 00:36:49.498
Uh, please,
I'm waiting for a friend.

233
00:36:50.082 --> 00:36:53.336
You and everyone else
who never actually move their car.

234
00:36:54.086 --> 00:36:57.631
I can't go easy on nonresidents.
If I let it slide, there goes my job.

235
00:36:57.632 --> 00:37:00.967
Yeah, yeah, it's just that
my friend's coming down. For real.

236
00:37:00.968 --> 00:37:02.553
Which block is your friend in?

237
00:37:04.263 --> 00:37:05.431
In two. Where I was.

238
00:37:06.933 --> 00:37:09.018
It's my second one this week!

239
00:37:09.894 --> 00:37:12.395
- Please! She's on her way!
- Ma'am! Please don't touch me.

240
00:37:12.396 --> 00:37:15.232
- I'm sorry! Those tickets cost a fortune.
- Eun-su! Hi!

241
00:37:15.233 --> 00:37:17.359
Goodness, Mrs. Jo! Please...

242
00:37:17.360 --> 00:37:19.320
Hold on. I'll take that off!

243
00:37:24.742 --> 00:37:26.618
Sorry. We're late for a show.
Have a good night!

244
00:37:26.619 --> 00:37:27.787
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

245
00:37:45.680 --> 00:37:47.014
I need to check something.

246
00:38:09.036 --> 00:38:10.788
- All set.
- Mm.

247
00:38:47.283 --> 00:38:48.743
Can't you go faster?

248
00:38:49.243 --> 00:38:51.912
I don't wanna risk anything.
If we get in an accident,

249
00:38:52.663 --> 00:38:54.165
we're totally screwed.

250
00:38:57.960 --> 00:38:59.712
I just want this over with.

251
00:39:00.212 --> 00:39:01.839
It's been harder than I thought.

252
00:39:28.449 --> 00:39:29.825
You know, you keep doing that.

253
00:39:31.243 --> 00:39:32.078
What?

254
00:39:32.870 --> 00:39:35.414
It's like you're washing your hands.

255
00:39:35.956 --> 00:39:37.958
Oh. They feel really sweaty.

256
00:39:43.964 --> 00:39:45.383
Hey, this will be over soon.

257
00:39:47.176 --> 00:39:48.177
Mm-hmm.

258
00:39:54.100 --> 00:39:55.726
Hey, come on! Stop.

259
00:39:56.227 --> 00:39:58.521
You know there's nothing
on your hands, Hui-su.

260
00:40:00.314 --> 00:40:01.940
Right. I'll stop.

261
00:41:12.428 --> 00:41:15.931
- Almost there...
- Oh, you gotta see this.

262
00:41:17.433 --> 00:41:18.600
What's so funny?

263
